            0.661
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "There are many things in the soil, such as sand, insects and worms. There may be many small organisms that we cannot see with our naked eyes. Plants and animals also become part of the soil as they decompose and decay. The"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
